Model weights
  google/timesfm-3.0-pytorch is released under the TimesFM Non-Commercial
  License v1.0 and is NOT covered by the MIT license above. This project uses
  it for research only. Anyone reusing this code commercially must obtain
  their own rights to the weights, or substitute another model.
  https://huggingface.co/google/timesfm-3.0-pytorch/blob/main/LICENSE

Data
  No third-party data is redistributed in this repository; data/raw/ is
  gitignored and rebuilt by scripts/fetch_data.py. Source terms:
    - River discharge, reservoir bulletins: Central Water Commission /
      National Water Informatics Centre, published as open data
      ("other-open"); Government of India open data is governed by the
      Government Open Data License - India. Attribution required.
      https://www.data.gov.in/Godl
    - ONI: NOAA Climate Prediction Center (public domain, US Government work)
    - DMI: NOAA Physical Sciences Laboratory (public domain)
    - Rainfall/temperature: Open-Meteo, ERA5-derived, CC-BY 4.0
  The small result CSVs tracked under data/processed/ are derived analytical
  outputs of this project, released under the MIT license above.
